dding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Ago a 15 Set)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16 Set a 22 Nov)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partidas escalonadas no Complexo Desportivo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra: Trail 32 km \u00e0s 08:30, Trail Sprint 19 km \u00e0s 09:15, Mini-Trail 13 km \u00e0s 09:30 e Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09:40.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por quatro percursos (95% em trilhos e caminhos rurais): Trail de 32 km com 1600m D+ (tempo limite de 5 horas), Trail Sprint de 19 km com 850m D+ (limite de 4 horas), Mini-Trail de 13 km com 550m D+ (limite de 3 horas) e uma Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 10 km com 300m D+.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em duas fases: na 1\u00aa fase (1 de agosto a 15 de setembro) custam 20 \u20ac (32 km), 18 \u20ac (19 km), 16 \u20ac (13 km) e 12 \u20ac (Caminhada); na 2\u00aa fase (16 de setembro a 22 de novembro) passam para 22 \u20ac (32 km), 20 \u20ac (19 km), 18 \u20ac (13 km) e 14 \u20ac (Caminhada). Atletas filiados na ADAL t\u00eam 1 \u20ac de desconto no Trail e Trail Sprint. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (at\u00e9 22\/11), refei\u00e7\u00e3o, entrada no Festival do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra, pr\u00e9mio finisher, seguro, banhos e massagem.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas das provas de trail?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para os percursos competitivos (32 km, 19 km e 13 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel com chip, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo de 1 litro no Trail 32 km e 0,50 litro no Trail Sprint e Mini-Trail), copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e telem\u00f3vel operacional. A falta de qualquer item implica 15 minutos de penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e quem organiza o Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo SerranosRun Team \/ Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra, com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Leiria, da Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Santa Catarina da Serra e Chain\u00e7a e da Forserra. O levantamento de dorsais decorre no Complexo Desportivo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra (Rua da Portela, n\u00ba 21) no s\u00e1bado (28 de novembro) das 16:00 \u00e0s 19:00 e no domingo (29 de novembro) a partir das 07:00.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\